<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-049" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-049-fangsengji" source-id="s-nanqishu-049-fangsengji-ws2261984">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-049-fangsengji:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">時竟陵太守<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-fangsengji:p001:m0005" ref="d61_8b9_780">房僧寄</persName>被代還至郢，東昏敕<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-fangsengji:p001:m0017" ref="d61_8b9_780">僧寄</persName>留守魯山，除驍騎將軍。<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-fangsengji:p001:m0030" ref="d61_8b9_780">僧寄</persName>謂<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-fangsengji:p001:m0033" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAACBB">沖</persName>曰：「臣雖未荷朝廷深恩，實蒙先帝厚澤。蔭其樹者不折其枝，實欲微立塵效。」<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-fangsengji:p001:m0070" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAACBB">沖</persName>深相許諾，共結盟誓。乃分部拒守。遣軍主<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-fangsengji:p001:m0090" ref="48f_b84_1de">孫樂祖</persName>數千人助<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-fangsengji:p001:m0097" ref="d61_8b9_780">僧寄</persName>據魯山岸立城壘。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-049-fangsengji:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-049-fangsengji:p002:m0000" ref="d61_8b9_780">房僧寄</persName>病死，</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-049-fangsengji:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">贈<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-fangsengji:p003:m0001" ref="d61_8b9_780">僧寄</persName>益州刺史。</p>
</text>
